flowchart TD
    A([Generation parameters submitted]) --> B{Input valid?}
    B -- No --> C[Report validation errors]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D[Generate routine proposal]
    D --> E[Trainer reviews proposal]
    E --> F{Accept as-is?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Approve program]
    F -- No --> H{Can be adjusted?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Manually adjust routine]
    I --> J[Review adjusted routine]
    J --> K{Approved?}
    K -- Yes --> G
    K -- No --> L[Return for correction]
    H -- No --> L
    L --> D
    G --> M[Assign program to client]
    M --> N([Available to client])
